{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SUPER STRIPE is a high-speed flight combat game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game system is typified by the classic SEGA arcade game &quot;Afterburner&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The controls are very simple, and you can wipe out enemies with multiple lock-ons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The fundamental point is the sense of superiority, but it is a logical game design that can express new possibilities, including the viewpoint, sense of speed, and offense and defense, and I believe that it is a game system that can be further developed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About the gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player invades using multiple lock-ons and Vulcans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The stage progresses depending on the distance invaded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are branches at the stage transition, and the player can choose which one to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each stage is composed of a variety of landscapes, such as mountainous areas, valleys, lakes, seas, and city buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About the graphics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These 3D graphics are expressed with Real-time GI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3684040?t=1745653518","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684040/a0ea9d875c23b0ea453030113003983b2431fae1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745653518","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684040/35ef59b774cb97e3fa78e07117be46a4304dc50e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745653518","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684040/35ef59b774cb97e3fa78e07117be46a4304dc50e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745653518","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SUPER STRIPE is a high-speed flight combat game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game system is typified by the classic SEGA arcade game &quot;Afterburner&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The controls are very simple, and you can wipe out enemies with multiple lock-ons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The fundamental point is the sense of superiority, but it is a logical game design that can express new possibilities, including the viewpoint, sense of speed, and offense and defense, and I believe that it is a game system that can be further developed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About the gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player invades using multiple lock-ons and Vulcans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The stage progresses depending on the distance invaded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are branches at the stage transition, and the player can choose which one to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each stage is composed of a variety of landscapes, such as mountainous areas, valleys, lakes, seas, and city buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About the graphics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These 3D graphics are expressed with Real-time GI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["windfallsoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3684040/5d808af47ccc94f4b41ed4626a8bf1c23036739c/header.jpg?t=1745653518","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257131235,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131235/movie480.mp4?t=174